Adapted portions (modified: rewritten, restructured, renamed identifiers to TeleDesign protocols,
values re-specified):

  discovery.md               from apps/daemon/src/prompts/discovery.ts, core-slim.ts
                             (question-form round trip, brand-source branch) and
                             apps/daemon/src/prompts/directions.ts (five-direction library;
                             directions renamed, brand references removed, fonts and palette
                             values changed)
  charter.md                 from apps/daemon/src/prompts/core-slim.ts
                             (instruction-priority order, refinement-turn rules)
  tweaks.md                  from design-templates/tweaks/SKILL.md
                             (knob catalogue, curated-swatch and knob-count rules)
  critique.md                from design-templates/critique/SKILL.md and docs/critique-theater.md
                             (five-dimension review shape, scoring discipline)
  kinds/mobile_app.md        from apps/daemon/src/prompts/core-slim.ts, discovery.ts
                             (per-platform delivery contracts)
  craft/anti_slop.md         from craft/anti-ai-slop.md
  craft/layout_spacing.md    from apps/daemon/src/prompts/core-slim.ts
                             (layout-integrity invariants, text-over-image rule)
  craft/accessibility.md     from apps/daemon/src/prompts/core-slim.ts
                             (interaction-state contrast rules)
  craft/imagery_icons.md     from apps/daemon/src/prompts/core-slim.ts
                             (real-first image sourcing, image-geometry rules)

