Protocol compatibility (identifiers only, no text reused): the tweak messages
__edit_mode_available / __activate_edit_mode / __deactivate_edit_mode / __edit_mode_set_keys /
__edit_mode_dismissed and the /*EDITMODE-BEGIN*/ … /*EDITMODE-END*/ markers are kept so that
projects exported from Claude Design can be imported. The .pen document shape (version 2.19) is
followed so that .pen files interoperate with pen.dev; no pen.dev text, code or assets are included.
